#: 06b4a549491e4602b6e71f2c8454eeb6
msgid ""
"On-Screen Display (OSD) Boards overlay telemetry data from an autopilot over"
" a First Person View monitor. This landing page shows various OSD boards and"
" techniques."
msgstr "屏幕显示（OSD）板将飞控的数传数据叠加在第一人称视角显示器上。本页介绍各种 OSD 板及使用技术。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-osd-boards-on-screen-display.rst:10
#: e1d0045709834366aefc9a4930a2f581
msgid ""
"Some autopilot boards have an analog OSD integrated, or andlog video OSD can"
" be via an external MAVLink or MSP connected board, or via MSP telemetry to "
"screens and goggles."
msgstr ""
"部分飞控板集成了模拟 OSD，或者可通过外部 MAVLink 或 MSP 连接板实现模拟视频 OSD，也可通过 MSP 数传将数据发送到屏幕和头显。"

